<title>BELGIUM: EU sugar management committee to hold routine meeting.</title>
<headline>EU sugar management committee to hold routine meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee will hold a routine meeting on Wednesday, an EU official said on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Committee will deal with the usual list of export refunds and molasses import duties but no other items are listed for discussion,&quot; the official said.</p>
</text>
